              380.36590576171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "in Chapter 9, in 14 CFR parts 175-225, and also on the FAA ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              381.6158752441406,
              524.4797973632812,
              391.6158752441406
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "23, 25, 27, and 29 that the FAA and the designer have agreed ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              382.86590576171875,
              275.5801086425781,
              392.86590576171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "website at www.faa.gov. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              394.1158752441406,
              386.6400146484375,
              404.1158752441406
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "are appropriate for the proposed aircraft.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              395.36590576171875,
              198.1600341796875,
              405.36590576171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Lift and Basic Aerodynamics",
            "font_name": "Helvetica-Bold",
            "font_size": 12.0,
            "color": "#EF4144",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              417.6815185546875,
              448.78778076171875,
              429.6815185546875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The FAA issues a Type Certificate (TC) for the product ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              420.36590576171875,
              275.4081115722656,
              430.36590576171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "when they are satisfied it complies with the applicable ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              432.86590576171875,
              275.4079895019531,
              442.86590576171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In order to understand the operation of the major components ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              435.1632080078125,
              524.6115112304688,
              445.1632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "airworthiness standards. When the TC is issued, a Type ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              445.36590576171875,
              275.4578857421875,
              455.36590576171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and subcomponents of an aircraft, it is important to ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              447.6632080078125,
              524.6399536132812,
              457.6632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Certificate Data Sheet (TCDS) is generated that specifies ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              457.86590576171875,
              275.5060729980469,
              467.86590576171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "understand basic aerodynamic concepts. This chapter briefly ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              460.1632080078125,
              524.47998046875,
              470.1632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "the important design and operational characteristics of the ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              470.36590576171875,
              275.49700927734375,
              480.36590576171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "introduces aerodynamics; a more detailed explanation can be ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              472.6632080078125,
              524.375732421875,
              482.6632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "aircraft, aircraft engine, or propeller. The TCDS defines the ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              482.86590576171875,
              275.5030212402344,
              492.86590576171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "found in Chapter 5, Aerodynamics of Flight.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              485.1632080078125,
              463.3199768066406,
              495.1632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "product and are available to the public from the FAA website ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              495.36590576171875,
              275.4480895996094,
              505.36590576171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "at www.faa.gov.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              507.8658752441406,
              102.09001159667969,
              517.8659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Four forces act upon an aircraft in relation to straight-andlevel, unaccelerated flight. These forces are thrust, lift, ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              510.1632385253906,
              522.0250854492188,
              520.1632690429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A Note About Light Sport Aircraft",
            "font_name": "Helvetica-Bold",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              532.8928833007812,
              194.3300018310547,
              542.8928833007812
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "weight, and drag. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              535.1632690429688,
              356.92999267578125,
              545.1632690429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Light sport aircraft are not designed according to FAA ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              545.8659057617188,
              275.515869140625,
              555.8659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "airworthiness standards. Instead, they are designed to a ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              558.3659057617188,
              275.6228332519531,
              568.3659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thrust is the forward force produced by the powerplant/",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              560.1632690429688,
              522.089599609375,
              570.1632690429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "consensus of standards agreed upon in the aviation industry. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              570.8659057617188,
              275.5119934082031,
              580.8659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "propeller. It opposes or overcomes the force of drag. As a ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              572.6632690429688,
              524.4959106445312,
              582.6632690429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The FAA has agreed the consensus of standards is acceptable ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              583.3659057617188,
              275.5849304199219,
              593.3659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "general rule, it is said to act parallel to the longitudinal axis. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              585.1632690429688,
              524.5201416015625,
              595.1632690429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "as the design criteria for these aircraft. Light sport aircraft do ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              595.8659057617188,
              275.6401062011719,
              605.8659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This is not always the case as explained later.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              597.6632690429688,
              466.9100646972656,
              607.6632690429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "not necessarily have individually type certificated engines ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              608.3659057617188,
              275.5110168457031,
              618.3659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and propellers. Instead, a TC is issued to the aircraft as a ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              620.8659057617188,
              275.5040283203125,
              630.8659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Drag is a rearward, retarding force and is caused by disruption ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              622.6632690429688,
              524.5897827148438,
              632.6632690429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "whole. It includes the airframe, engine, and propeller.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              633.3659057617188,
              250.67002868652344,
              643.3659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "of airflow by the wing, fuselage, and other protruding objects. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              635.1632690429688,
              524.5400390625,
              645.1632690429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Drag opposes thrust and acts rearward parallel to the relative ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              647.6632690429688,
              524.335693359375,
              657.6632690429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aircraft, aircraft engines, and propellers can be manufactured ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              658.3659057617188,
              275.5439453125,
              668.3659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "wind.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              660.1632690429688,
              307.5,
              670.1632690429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "one at a time from the design drawings, or through an FAA ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              670.8659057617188,
              275.47601318359375,
              680.8659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "approved manufacturing process, depending on the size and ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              683.3659057617188,
              275.5030517578125,
              693.3659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "capabilities of the manufacturer. During the manufacturing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              695.8659057617188,
              275.5180358886719,
              705.8659057617188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "[Figure 3-1] ",
            "font_name": "Times-Italic",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              356.92999267578125,
              535.188232421875,
              410.260009765625,
              545.188232421875
            ]
          }
        ]
